1
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:09,230
Genya!

2
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:57,010
EPISODE 6:
AREN'T YOU GOING TO BECOME A HASHIRA?

3
00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:12,980
Gen...

4
00:02:12,980 --> 00:02:14,230
ya...

5
00:02:17,490 --> 00:02:19,990
What kind of slashing attack was that?

6
00:02:19,990 --> 00:02:22,120
I can't regenerate!

7
00:02:20,490 --> 00:02:22,120
<i>The attack worked!</i>

8
00:02:22,120 --> 00:02:25,040
The pain is scorching me!

9
00:02:22,530 --> 00:02:23,910
Calm down! You're pathetic!

10
00:02:24,620 --> 00:02:27,040
It takes time, but we can regenerate!

11
00:02:28,660 --> 00:02:30,670
<i>I don't know
what's going on with Genya,</i>

12
00:02:30,670 --> 00:02:33,170
<i>but I've figured something out
because he slashed one of them!</i>

13
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:36,340
<i>Looks like even if we behead
all four at the same time,</i>

14
00:02:36,340 --> 00:02:39,180
<i>we can't finish them off
like we did Gyutaro!</i>

15
00:02:40,550 --> 00:02:44,430
<i>Attacking these four Emotion Demons
is pretty much pointless!</i>

16
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:46,430
Nezuko!

17
00:02:48,600 --> 00:02:49,600
Nezuko!

18
00:02:54,980 --> 00:02:55,980
Nezuko!

19
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:02,070
<i>Something's been bothering me all this time.</i>

20
00:03:04,160 --> 00:03:07,120
<i>Is it possible that their heads
aren't their vital spots?</i>

21
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,460
<i>Something felt so off.</i>

22
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:12,210
<i>That scent that I caught
for just an instant...</i>

23
00:03:12,670 --> 00:03:13,670
<i>Right.</i>

24
00:03:13,670 --> 00:03:14,920
<i>That was...</i>

25
00:03:15,290 --> 00:03:17,380
<i>the scent of a fifth demon!</i>

26
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,300
<i>There's a fifth demon!</i>

27
00:03:19,970 --> 00:03:21,430
<i>I have to find it!</i>

28
00:03:21,760 --> 00:03:23,470
<i>The fifth demon's head's got to be...</i>

29
00:03:26,350 --> 00:03:28,020
Don't get so full of yourself!

30
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:30,810
I'm the one who's going to defeat...

31
00:03:30,810 --> 00:03:32,020
an Upper Rank!

32
00:03:32,020 --> 00:03:32,980
Genya...

33
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:37,150
You didn't defeat
Upper Six on your own!

34
00:03:37,150 --> 00:03:40,150
That's why you haven't become a Hashira!

35
00:03:40,150 --> 00:03:41,740
Uh, yeah, that's right!

36
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:44,450
You can bet...

37
00:03:44,910 --> 00:03:46,620
that I'm going to...

38
00:03:46,620 --> 00:03:47,790
beat you to it!

39
00:03:47,790 --> 00:03:50,540
Genya! You're drooling, okay?
What's wrong?

40
00:03:50,540 --> 00:03:52,620
Not to mention, you're choking me!

41
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,880
I'm the one who's going to become a Hashira!

42
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,590
I see!

43
00:03:57,590 --> 00:03:58,880
I get it, sure!

44
00:03:58,880 --> 00:04:01,010
Nezuko and I will give you our full support!

45
00:04:01,010 --> 00:04:02,630
Let's give it our all, all three of us!

46
00:04:03,010 --> 00:04:04,010
Huh?

47
00:04:04,010 --> 00:04:06,140
I'm sure there's a fifth demon somewhere!

48
00:04:06,140 --> 00:04:08,850
I'll look for it,
so I want you to buy me some time!

49
00:04:08,850 --> 00:04:11,180
I know what you're up to!

50
00:04:11,180 --> 00:04:13,940
You're just making me
let my guard down, and—

51
00:04:15,230 --> 00:04:16,230
Huh?

52
00:04:19,530 --> 00:04:20,190
Look out!

53
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:28,660
<i>The Anger Demon's revived already!</i>

54
00:04:28,950 --> 00:04:29,950
<i>Hurry!</i>

55
00:04:30,290 --> 00:04:31,000
Genya!

56
00:04:31,750 --> 00:04:34,000
I'll let you know
as soon as I've found the fifth demon,

57
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,580
so keep these demons at bay!

58
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,920
They've all regenerated, dammit!

59
00:04:40,670 --> 00:04:43,170
Whatever you do,
just don't slash Nezuko!

60
00:04:43,170 --> 00:04:44,840
Because she's my little sister!

61
00:04:46,010 --> 00:04:47,010
Uh...

62
00:04:53,770 --> 00:04:55,100
<i>Where's that fifth demon?</i>

63
00:04:58,480 --> 00:05:01,400
<i>I have to find it while Genya and Nezuko
are fending off the others!</i>

64
00:05:08,950 --> 00:05:09,830
<i>What's this?</i>

65
00:05:10,580 --> 00:05:12,910
<i>Thanks to the wind
created by that demon with the fan,</i>

66
00:05:12,910 --> 00:05:15,250
<i>the sulphur smell
from the hot springs is gone!</i>

67
00:05:16,210 --> 00:05:17,500
<i>Find it!</i>

68
00:05:18,130 --> 00:05:19,880
<i>Concentrate!</i>

69
00:05:28,010 --> 00:05:29,850
It's all right!

70
00:05:29,850 --> 00:05:32,060
They'll never find me!

71
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:33,680
It's all right!

72
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:38,150
My four Emotions
will defeat those villains for me!

73
00:05:38,520 --> 00:05:39,520
<i>Found it!</i>

74
00:05:39,520 --> 00:05:41,820
<i>Found it! Found it! I found it!</i>

75
00:05:42,860 --> 00:05:44,070
Genya!

76
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,240
Urogi!

77
00:05:49,030 --> 00:05:50,660
Go straight, northeast!

78
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:55,790
The fifth demon's hiding itself
close to the ground!

79
00:06:02,420 --> 00:06:03,670
Genya!

80
00:06:04,130 --> 00:06:05,260
Go after it!

81
00:06:05,260 --> 00:06:06,470
I'll cover you!

82
00:06:06,470 --> 00:06:07,550
Northeast!

83
00:06:10,050 --> 00:06:12,050
<i>Crap, more lightning!</i>

84
00:06:15,350 --> 00:06:17,230
Nezuko! Go help Genya!

85
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:20,560
Don't let the Lightning Demon
get in Genya's way!

86
00:06:21,730 --> 00:06:23,480
DESTROY

87
00:06:30,450 --> 00:06:31,910
<i>Don't let yourself get swept away!</i>

88
00:06:31,910 --> 00:06:34,370
<i>Stay in this spot, no matter what!</i>

89
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:38,120
<i>This is bad! Here comes
a lightning attack, too!</i>

90
00:06:50,550 --> 00:06:53,300
Nezuko!

91
00:06:57,770 --> 00:07:00,440
Hyo, hyo, hyo!

92
00:07:01,350 --> 00:07:03,810
Is it excruciating?

93
00:07:04,150 --> 00:07:06,980
It must be excruciating!

94
00:07:08,490 --> 00:07:09,990
UPPER FIVE

95
00:07:12,740 --> 00:07:14,830
<i>So, it's the same everywhere?</i>

96
00:07:14,830 --> 00:07:16,490
Hyo, hyo, hyo!

97
00:07:17,290 --> 00:07:20,500
Not only are you unable
to unleash your breathing techniques,

98
00:07:20,500 --> 00:07:24,750
but you'll soon be drawing
your last breath in there, too!

99
00:07:28,170 --> 00:07:31,880
Hyo, hyo, hyo!

100
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:34,090
That look of fake stoicism...

101
00:07:34,090 --> 00:07:36,140
How very sublime it is!

102
00:07:36,680 --> 00:07:41,140
My creative juices are simply gushing!

103
00:07:44,310 --> 00:07:45,480
Don't fight back.

104
00:07:46,020 --> 00:07:47,780
You're making me sad.

105
00:07:47,780 --> 00:07:48,530
Sekido...

106
00:07:48,530 --> 00:07:51,780
UPPER
FOUR

107
00:07:49,150 --> 00:07:51,780
I know! I'm going to crucify her—

108
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:03,290
UPPER
FOUR

109
00:08:02,370 --> 00:08:03,290
<i>That youngster...</i>

110
00:08:03,960 --> 00:08:06,710
<i>Now he's even faster than before!</i>

111
00:08:06,710 --> 00:08:07,420
<i>No.</i>

112
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:09,590
<i>Even from the moment I first met him...</i>

113
00:08:09,590 --> 00:08:11,590
<i>he's exceeded all of his reports!</i>

114
00:08:11,970 --> 00:08:15,090
<i>Those unbelievable reflexes!
His ability to adapt himself in combat!</i>

115
00:08:19,890 --> 00:08:23,100
<i>That explosive growth he displays
when he's on the brink!</i>

116
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,280
<i>Damn!</i>

117
00:08:33,820 --> 00:08:35,530
<i>Karaku! Karaku!</i>

118
00:08:38,870 --> 00:08:40,740
You little punk!

119
00:08:44,040 --> 00:08:45,290
All right!

120
00:08:45,290 --> 00:08:48,170
Now I just gotta go
after that bullet-popping kid!

121
00:08:48,500 --> 00:08:49,380
Huh?

122
00:08:50,710 --> 00:08:51,420
Damn!

123
00:08:51,960 --> 00:08:53,550
I've been slashed!

124
00:08:54,050 --> 00:08:55,430
Damn you, punk!

125
00:08:55,930 --> 00:08:56,930
Genya!

126
00:08:57,340 --> 00:08:58,550
To your right!

127
00:08:58,550 --> 00:09:00,220
It's moving south!

128
00:09:00,220 --> 00:09:01,600
Search for it!

129
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:04,020
<i>Jeez! I am searching for it!</i>

130
00:09:04,020 --> 00:09:06,100
<i>I've been searching for it all this time!</i>

131
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:07,480
<i>A spell?</i>

132
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:10,400
<i>I can't see it because of another spell?</i>

133
00:09:10,400 --> 00:09:12,740
<i>Crap! Crap! Crap!</i>

134
00:09:12,740 --> 00:09:13,990
<i>Where are you?</i>

135
00:09:13,990 --> 00:09:17,910
<i>The longer this goes on,
the closer I get to being depleted!</i>

136
00:09:22,160 --> 00:09:23,580
Turn west!

137
00:09:23,580 --> 00:09:24,620
More to the right!

138
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:25,870
It's nearby!

139
00:09:25,870 --> 00:09:27,000
Down below!

140
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,130
<i>Where are you?</i>

141
00:09:29,880 --> 00:09:30,670
<i>Where—</i>

142
00:09:30,670 --> 00:09:32,460
Genya! Down below!

143
00:09:32,460 --> 00:09:33,260
Huh?

144
00:09:39,050 --> 00:09:40,550
<i>Puny!</i>

145
00:09:44,270 --> 00:09:45,980
<i>That thing's beyond small!</i>

146
00:09:45,980 --> 00:09:47,310
<i>This is the main body?</i>

147
00:09:47,850 --> 00:09:49,150
<i>This thing?</i>

148
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:52,270
<i>Dammit! How the hell am I supposed
to spot something like that?</i>

149
00:09:52,860 --> 00:09:55,440
<i>It's no bigger than a field mouse!</i>

150
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:57,820
<i>Those other four are crazy strong!</i>

151
00:09:57,820 --> 00:10:00,660
<i>And this little squirt's the one
that's controlling them?</i>

152
00:10:00,660 --> 00:10:02,740
<i>Fighting off those four demons...</i>

153
00:10:02,740 --> 00:10:04,500
<i>while chasing after this mouse...</i>

154
00:10:04,790 --> 00:10:06,540
<i>What a pain in the ass!</i>

155
00:10:06,540 --> 00:10:10,000
<i>Now I can see why so many Demon Slayers
keep ending up dead!</i>

156
00:10:10,250 --> 00:10:12,170
<i>Don't mess with me!
You're so annoying!</i>

157
00:10:12,550 --> 00:10:14,550
<i>What am I supposed to do
with all this rage?</i>

158
00:10:16,550 --> 00:10:19,220
<i>All right! I can do this! I win!</i>

159
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:26,680
<i>I-I can't slash it?</i>

160
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:27,810
<i>I can't slash it!</i>

161
00:10:28,230 --> 00:10:29,190
<i>No way!</i>

162
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:30,520
<i>No way!</i>

163
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:34,020
<i>Look at it! Its head
is no bigger than my finger!</i>

164
00:10:41,530 --> 00:10:43,240
<i>No good!</i>

165
00:10:47,660 --> 00:10:49,080
<i>Oh, crap!</i>

166
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,710
<i>I was too slow!</i>

167
00:10:51,250 --> 00:10:53,210
<i>I can't get out of the way!</i>

168
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:55,750
<i>I'm going to die.</i>

169
00:10:56,090 --> 00:10:58,720
<i>I can't regenerate my head.</i>

170
00:11:00,130 --> 00:11:05,810
DESTROY

171
00:11:02,050 --> 00:11:03,970
<i>Big Brother...</i>

172
00:11:07,390 --> 00:11:09,600
<i>I wanted to become a Hashira...</i>

173
00:11:09,940 --> 00:11:12,560
<i>so my big brother would acknowledge me.</i>

174
00:11:13,150 --> 00:11:14,610
<i>And...</i>

175
00:11:14,610 --> 00:11:16,690
<i>I also wanted to apologize...</i>

176
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:19,700
<i>for what I said that day!</i>

177
00:11:21,030 --> 00:11:26,040
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA
SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

178
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:31,040
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA
SWORDSMITH VILLAGE ARC

179
00:11:33,790 --> 00:11:36,090
<i>My mom...</i>

180
00:11:36,090 --> 00:11:38,760
<i>was such a tiny person.</i>

181
00:11:39,220 --> 00:11:44,550
<i>I grew taller than her at an early age.</i>

182
00:11:45,970 --> 00:11:50,810
<i>My mother was always working,
from morning until night.</i>

183
00:11:51,520 --> 00:11:56,400
<i>Not once did I ever see her sleeping.</i>

184
00:11:58,610 --> 00:12:03,200
<i>My father was not only a big guy,
but he was also a good-for-nothing.</i>

185
00:12:03,820 --> 00:12:06,910
<i>He got stabbed to death
by someone with a grudge...</i>

186
00:12:06,910 --> 00:12:08,700
<i>which served him right.</i>

187
00:12:09,200 --> 00:12:10,620
<i>The old man...</i>

188
00:12:10,620 --> 00:12:14,080
<i>was always beating up
my mother and us kids.</i>

189
00:12:15,380 --> 00:12:17,800
<i>With that tiny body of hers...</i>

190
00:12:18,130 --> 00:12:21,300
<i>our mother would shield us
from our monstrous father...</i>

191
00:12:21,300 --> 00:12:24,390
<i>without so much as flinching.</i>

192
00:12:24,390 --> 00:12:26,760
<i>I think she was amazing.</i>

193
00:12:47,780 --> 00:12:50,240
Mom's late, isn't she?

194
00:12:51,290 --> 00:12:52,450
Huh?

195
00:12:56,080 --> 00:12:57,290
Genya...

196
00:12:57,290 --> 00:12:58,750
You can't sleep?

197
00:12:58,750 --> 00:13:00,460
Well, neither can you, Big Brother.

198
00:13:01,880 --> 00:13:03,970
I'm going to go look for Mom.

199
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:05,760
Oh, I'll go with you.

200
00:13:06,180 --> 00:13:07,430
No.

201
00:13:07,430 --> 00:13:10,640
I'll go. I want you to stay home.

202
00:13:14,560 --> 00:13:15,900
We promised, remember?

203
00:13:18,020 --> 00:13:19,440
Okay.

204
00:13:24,280 --> 00:13:25,950
All right, I'm counting on you.

205
00:13:26,610 --> 00:13:27,660
Yeah.

206
00:13:39,590 --> 00:13:40,880
Big Brother!

207
00:13:41,300 --> 00:13:42,460
Big Brother!

208
00:13:43,050 --> 00:13:44,380
Big Brother!

209
00:13:45,090 --> 00:13:46,130
Big Brother!

210
00:13:48,390 --> 00:13:51,890
Hey, I didn't know you were all awake.

211
00:13:55,980 --> 00:13:58,980
You think Mom's okay?

212
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:01,020
She's fine, all right?

213
00:14:01,020 --> 00:14:03,820
Big Brother went to look for her.

214
00:14:03,820 --> 00:14:05,070
But...

215
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:11,240
She's never been this late before.

216
00:14:12,030 --> 00:14:15,000
The sun will be coming up soon.

217
00:14:15,330 --> 00:14:16,870
It's okay.

218
00:14:16,870 --> 00:14:19,670
You must be tired.
Go to sleep, all right?

219
00:14:19,670 --> 00:14:23,630
I bet Mom and Big Brother
will be back when you wake up.

220
00:14:27,130 --> 00:14:28,260
It's Mom!

221
00:14:28,550 --> 00:14:29,720
Mom!

222
00:14:29,970 --> 00:14:31,550
- Mom!
- Mom!

223
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:34,430
Wait!

224
00:14:34,430 --> 00:14:35,270
Don't open the door!

225
00:14:35,270 --> 00:14:36,680
It might not be Mom—

226
00:14:48,570 --> 00:14:50,780
<i>Is it a beast? A stray dog?</i>

227
00:14:50,780 --> 00:14:52,530
<i>No! It's a wolf!</i>

228
00:14:53,830 --> 00:14:55,660
<i>I can't see it! It's too dark!</i>

229
00:14:56,370 --> 00:14:57,040
<i>It's so fast!</i>

230
00:14:58,870 --> 00:15:00,120
Genya! Run!

231
00:15:01,210 --> 00:15:02,000
Big Brother!

232
00:15:11,050 --> 00:15:12,050
Koto!

233
00:15:12,430 --> 00:15:13,260
Shuya!

234
00:15:14,260 --> 00:15:15,220
Hiroshi!

235
00:15:15,220 --> 00:15:16,100
Teiko!

236
00:15:16,100 --> 00:15:17,140
Sumi!

237
00:15:18,430 --> 00:15:20,640
P-Put pressure on your wounds!

238
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,440
I'll go get the doctor right away!

239
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:25,480
Just hang on a little longer!

240
00:15:32,410 --> 00:15:34,990
<i>Wh-What's going on?</i>

241
00:15:34,990 --> 00:15:37,160
<i>What was that thing just now?</i>

242
00:15:37,160 --> 00:15:38,370
<i>Where's Big Brother?</i>

243
00:15:38,370 --> 00:15:41,370
<i>No, right now, I have to see to their wounds!</i>

244
00:15:47,420 --> 00:15:48,260
Big Brother—

245
00:15:52,720 --> 00:15:54,010
Mom!

246
00:15:56,720 --> 00:16:00,560
Mom! Mom!
 Why'd you do it?

247
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:02,100
Why'd you do it?

248
00:16:02,100 --> 00:16:04,730
Why'd you kill our mother?

249
00:16:06,860 --> 00:16:08,690
You murderer!

250
00:16:09,360 --> 00:16:12,530
You murderer!

251
00:16:14,990 --> 00:16:19,080
<i>I'm sorry I said
those awful things, Big Brother.</i>

252
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:21,290
<i>It's all...</i>

253
00:16:21,620 --> 00:16:24,120
<i>It's all just excuses...</i>

254
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:25,960
<i>but I was in a panic.</i>

255
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:32,340
<i>Shuya, Hiroshi, Koto, Teiko and Sumi
were all lying there dead...</i>

256
00:16:32,680 --> 00:16:34,550
<i>not answering me.</i>

257
00:16:35,930 --> 00:16:37,220
<i>"It's over."</i>

258
00:16:37,220 --> 00:16:40,560
<i>I knew that I was about to die.</i>

259
00:16:41,930 --> 00:16:43,440
<i>And that wolf...</i>

260
00:16:44,650 --> 00:16:47,270
<i>What I thought was a wolf...</i>

261
00:16:47,940 --> 00:16:50,780
<i>was our mother,
who'd turned into a demon.</i>

262
00:16:52,320 --> 00:16:55,320
<i>You fought her to protect us...</i>

263
00:16:55,660 --> 00:16:58,120
<i>running outside
where day was starting to break.</i>

264
00:16:59,030 --> 00:17:04,290
<i>When you first realized
it was Mom who'd attacked our family...</i>

265
00:17:06,210 --> 00:17:09,550
<i>how did it make you feel, Big Brother?</i>

266
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:13,760
<i>When you stood there, shattered...</i>

267
00:17:14,090 --> 00:17:16,680
<i>after killing our beloved mother...</i>

268
00:17:17,140 --> 00:17:20,970
<i>and the brother you'd fought tooth and nail
to protect denounced you...</i>

269
00:17:20,970 --> 00:17:23,560
<i>how did that make you feel?</i>

270
00:17:25,690 --> 00:17:28,110
<i>When we'd only just promised
each other...</i>

271
00:17:28,110 --> 00:17:31,610
<i>to protect the family together!</i>

272
00:17:41,580 --> 00:17:42,620
Genya...

273
00:17:42,620 --> 00:17:43,620
Huh?

274
00:17:44,580 --> 00:17:47,500
Let's protect our family together,
you and me.

275
00:17:47,500 --> 00:17:48,500
Um...

276
00:17:48,500 --> 00:17:51,090
Dad got himself stabbed,
and now he's dead.

277
00:17:51,090 --> 00:17:53,880
I feel a lot easier with him
out of the picture...

278
00:17:55,260 --> 00:17:57,470
but without a father around...

279
00:17:57,840 --> 00:18:00,550
everyone will feel lonely.

280
00:18:03,640 --> 00:18:05,100
From now on...

281
00:18:05,430 --> 00:18:07,230
you and I...

282
00:18:07,230 --> 00:18:10,270
are going to protect Mom and our siblings.

283
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,730
Got that?

284
00:18:16,950 --> 00:18:18,610
What you mean is...

285
00:18:18,610 --> 00:18:22,030
"from now on, too..."

286
00:18:22,030 --> 00:18:23,910
right?

287
00:18:25,960 --> 00:18:26,910
Yeah.

288
00:18:34,130 --> 00:18:36,050
<i>Sorry, Big Brother.</i>

289
00:18:36,590 --> 00:18:40,470
<i>I'm going to die
without getting a chance to say I'm sorry.</i>

290
00:18:41,970 --> 00:18:44,810
<i>And that memory of you
smiling at me...</i>

291
00:18:45,140 --> 00:18:47,980
<i>will be the last thing I see.</i>

292
00:18:49,060 --> 00:18:52,820
<i>I had no talent, Big Brother.</i>

293
00:18:53,150 --> 00:18:55,320
<i>I can't use breathing techniques...</i>

294
00:18:55,320 --> 00:18:57,650
<i>and I'll never become a Hashira.</i>

295
00:18:58,200 --> 00:19:04,120
DESTROY

296
00:18:58,490 --> 00:19:02,490
<i>Unless I become a Hashira,
I can never meet the other Hashira.</i>

297
00:19:02,910 --> 00:19:04,870
<i>I gave it my all...</i>

298
00:19:04,870 --> 00:19:07,080
<i>but it was beyond me.</i>

299
00:19:07,620 --> 00:19:09,870
<i>A slowpoke like you...</i>

300
00:19:09,870 --> 00:19:12,080
<i>You're no brother of mine!</i>

301
00:19:12,080 --> 00:19:13,920
<i>Just quit the Demon Slayer Corps!</i>

302
00:19:15,750 --> 00:19:17,800
<i>But why?</i>

303
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:20,260
<i>I am your brother!</i>

304
00:19:21,300 --> 00:19:22,390
Genya!

305
00:19:24,050 --> 00:19:25,060
Don't give up!

306
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:32,150
Go after it again!

307
00:19:33,020 --> 00:19:34,940
Slash it again!

308
00:19:35,230 --> 00:19:36,730
Whatever you do, don't give up!

309
00:19:36,730 --> 00:19:38,110
This time, you'll make it!

310
00:19:39,070 --> 00:19:40,400
I'll protect you, all right?

311
00:19:41,360 --> 00:19:43,200
Don't think about anything else
but beheading it!

312
00:19:44,620 --> 00:19:46,200
Aren't you going to become a Hashira?

313
00:19:46,660 --> 00:19:48,410
Genya Shinazugawa?

314
00:19:51,920 --> 00:19:52,790
<i>Oh no!</i>

315
00:19:52,790 --> 00:19:53,880
<i>Behind us!</i>

316
00:19:54,630 --> 00:19:56,670
<i>Weeping Spears.</i>

317
00:19:58,960 --> 00:20:00,970
<i>This is bad! I'm hit!</i>

318
00:20:00,970 --> 00:20:02,220
<i>Squarely!</i>

319
00:20:06,310 --> 00:20:07,470
Huh?

320
00:20:11,190 --> 00:20:12,650
Go!

321
00:20:13,520 --> 00:20:14,810
Genya!

322
00:20:19,570 --> 00:20:20,900
I can't...

323
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:22,740
behead it!

324
00:20:24,530 --> 00:20:25,870
You be the one...

325
00:20:26,410 --> 00:20:27,660
to behead it!

326
00:20:29,040 --> 00:20:30,620
Just this once...

327
00:20:30,960 --> 00:20:32,040
I'm going to...

328
00:20:33,790 --> 00:20:34,790
Genya...

329
00:20:39,260 --> 00:20:41,010
...let you have it!

330
00:20:52,230 --> 00:20:53,350
<i>I'll do it...</i>

331
00:20:53,350 --> 00:20:54,690
<i>no matter what!</i>

332
00:21:03,740 --> 00:21:04,660
<i>There it is!</i>

333
00:21:06,870 --> 00:21:07,740
<i>It's tiny!</i>

334
00:21:14,370 --> 00:21:15,960
<i>You're not getting away!</i>

335
00:22:59,980 --> 00:23:00,440
PART 6

336
00:23:01,810 --> 00:23:04,690
Genya, you didn't have
anything to eat again today.

337
00:23:04,690 --> 00:23:05,940
Are you okay?

338
00:23:06,280 --> 00:23:10,110
I hear that you haven't eaten
since we met at the Butterfly Mansion.

339
00:23:10,450 --> 00:23:12,780
<i>You can't battle demons unless you eat!</i>

340
00:23:12,780 --> 00:23:13,870
<i>That's right!</i>

341
00:23:13,870 --> 00:23:15,370
<i>I said I don't want anything!</i>

342
00:23:15,870 --> 00:23:18,120
You're always acting too familiar!

343
00:23:18,120 --> 00:23:19,290
But we're friends!

344
00:23:19,290 --> 00:23:21,210
Since when are we friends?

345
00:23:21,210 --> 00:23:23,210
Well, we soaked
in the hot springs together!

346
00:23:23,210 --> 00:23:24,840
That was only because you barged in—

347
00:23:24,840 --> 00:23:26,840
And we were in the same
Final Selection class, too!

348
00:23:27,130 --> 00:23:29,130
So, that makes us friends, right?

349
00:23:31,010 --> 00:23:33,220
I told you!
That's what's so annoying about—

350
00:23:33,220 --> 00:23:34,140
Hold up a second!

351
00:23:34,140 --> 00:23:36,640
Next, Episode 7, "Awful Villain."

352
00:23:36,640 --> 00:23:38,230
Genya, let's always be good friends!

353
00:23:38,230 --> 00:23:39,020
I said—

354
00:23:39,020 --> 00:23:40,020
TO BE CONTINUED

